1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:09,000
Rachel Green: Thanks for joining, Ahmed. I'd love to hear how the first month with our analytics dashboard has gone.

2
00:00:09,500 --> 00:00:22,000
Ahmed Khan: Overall it's been great. The weekly reports save my team a lot of time, but the export to Excel keeps timing out for large date ranges.

3
00:00:22,500 --> 00:00:31,000
Rachel Green: Thanks for flagging that. Roughly how large are the exports when they fail?

4
00:00:31,500 --> 00:00:40,000
Ahmed Khan: Anything above six months of data. Smaller exports work fine.

5
00:00:40,500 --> 00:00:52,000
Rachel Green: Understood. I'll open a ticket with engineering today and follow up with a workaround by Wednesday.

6
00:00:52,500 --> 00:01:05,000
Ahmed Khan: That would help. We're also interested in adding ten more seats for the finance team next quarter.

7
00:01:05,500 --> 00:01:15,000
Rachel Green: Great to hear. I'll send you a quote for ten additional seats with our annual discount.

8
00:01:15,500 --> 00:01:22,000
Ahmed Khan: Perfect, please send it to me and our procurement lead.
